  "program": {
    "module": {
      "summary": "Scottish Council Tax Reduction (SSI 2021/249) reg 79 — applicant's daily\nmaximum reduction.\n\nFor a dwelling with annual council tax A (net of discounts and other\nreductions) and B days in the financial year:\n  bands A–D:  daily_max = A/B − non_dep_deductions\n  bands E–H:  daily_max = (A − A/C)/B − non_dep_deductions\nwhere C is the band taper factor (E:1.075, F:1.125, G:1.175, H:1.225).\n\nReg 79(4): A is divided by the number of jointly and severally liable\npersons, except where the joint liability is partner-only. Students\n(reg 20(2) of the 2012 Act) are excluded from the liable count —\ncaller pre-applies `is_not_student` on each liable Person."
    },
